WEBVTT

00:17.610 --> 00:19.650
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:19.650 --> 00:23.180
In this wide world

00:24.490 --> 00:28.350
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:28.820 --> 00:34.930
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:34.930 --> 00:38.560
I think you're aware of them

00:40.740 --> 00:45.670
Take off that restrictive weight

00:45.670 --> 00:48.640
Let your feelings go

00:48.640 --> 00:55.950
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:55.950 --> 00:58.710
Awaken now

00:59.890 --> 01:12.000
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

01:12.000 --> 01:19.270
If you do, you can always become happy

01:19.270 --> 01:22.040
It's certain

01:22.040 --> 01:26.410
Woh woh

01:32.090 --> 01:36.490
Dai-chan and I will be attending the
Student Council's budget meeting.

01:36.760 --> 01:41.130
So I want this place straightened up
by the time we get back.

01:41.460 --> 01:43.330
Time to go, Den-chan.

01:43.330 --> 01:44.670
Right on, Dai-chan!

01:44.670 --> 01:46.000
We must hurry!

01:46.000 --> 01:50.740
That's what they tell us to do, but the
truth is, most of this is their own stuff.

01:50.740 --> 01:54.840
It just goes to show how much trust
they place in you, doesn't it?

01:55.210 --> 01:57.940
I think they're just being lazy.

01:58.250 --> 02:00.380
Well, let's get started.

02:00.380 --> 02:01.280
Okay.

02:01.520 --> 02:04.620
But what should we do with this stuff?

02:04.620 --> 02:09.250
They stacked it so precariously that
if we move anything even a little...

02:10.630 --> 02:11.720
Hasegawa!

02:17.300 --> 02:20.100
Hasegawa, are you all right?! Hasegawa!

02:21.670 --> 02:23.640
You aren't hurt, are you?

02:24.740 --> 02:27.180
S-Senior! Behind you... just now!

02:27.180 --> 02:28.300
Huh?

02:30.280 --> 02:32.110
Could that have been...

02:32.450 --> 02:35.250
I'm glad neither of you were hurt!

02:35.380 --> 02:35.720
W-What? What was that?

02:35.720 --> 02:37.550
I see... Thanks, Belldandy.
W-What? What was that?

02:37.550 --> 02:39.280
I see... Thanks, Belldandy.

02:40.090 --> 02:41.890
You are welcome.

02:46.900 --> 02:48.520
I might have known.

02:50.470 --> 02:53.090
That's the one.

02:53.970 --> 02:59.910
Ah! Is That Jealousy?!

03:02.080 --> 03:06.780
Kakuta Laboratory
Ceramic Impact
Experiment on the Experiment
menu for today

03:03.410 --> 03:06.050
Okay, I'm going to go get some lunch.

03:07.380 --> 03:11.350
Hmm, I guess maybe the reactor's
temperature isn't stable?

03:11.350 --> 03:14.320
The intensity shouldn't be that high, though...

03:14.520 --> 03:17.790
Nothing is created without any failures.

03:18.590 --> 03:23.830
Each failure brings you closer to
finding a solution, after all.

03:24.100 --> 03:25.500
But, more importantly...

03:25.870 --> 03:29.500
Here! Have some lunch and cheer up!

03:29.570 --> 03:34.080
Morisato

03:30.240 --> 03:31.910
Yeah, you're right.

03:33.010 --> 03:34.040
Huh?

03:34.080 --> 03:37.510
Mr. Keiichi Morisato

03:34.810 --> 03:37.510
What's this? A letter?

03:39.450 --> 03:42.950
Shiho Sakakibara, 1st year Electronics major?

03:42.950 --> 03:44.750
Never heard of her.

03:46.650 --> 03:51.190
Let' see..."I'm sorry to send you
a letter like this all of a sudden."

03:51.190 --> 03:56.630
"I've been keeping these feelings pent up
inside since the moment I first saw you..."

03:56.630 --> 04:00.430
and though I tried many times to
speak to you, I was never able.

04:00.670 --> 04:04.760
But today I've found the courage,
and I want to tell you how I feel.

04:06.880 --> 04:08.670
Is this...

04:09.180 --> 04:12.850
one of those "love letters" you hear about?

04:12.850 --> 04:17.450
I've written one before, but I've
never RECEIVED one!

04:17.450 --> 04:18.750
What's this?

04:19.350 --> 04:23.850
Letters do express the sentiments of
those who write them, don't they?

04:23.960 --> 04:27.700
"I will wait in front of the
fountain until you come."

04:27.700 --> 04:28.990
"I will wait forever."

04:29.260 --> 04:29.730
Urd!

04:29.730 --> 04:30.160
Urd!
Keiichi, you dog, you!

04:30.160 --> 04:31.870
Keiichi, you dog, you!

04:31.870 --> 04:33.530
So you gonna go hook up with her?

04:33.530 --> 04:34.270
Huh?!

04:34.270 --> 04:36.740
I... I'm not hooking up with anyone!

04:36.740 --> 04:37.970
Hook up with?

04:39.940 --> 04:41.410
Hook up...

04:44.110 --> 04:45.610
What are you going to do?

04:45.610 --> 04:49.380
I predict she'll be totally cute!

04:50.150 --> 04:52.140
Is that right?

04:52.420 --> 04:54.260
What should I do?

04:54.260 --> 04:56.160
What should I say?

04:57.860 --> 05:00.900
I-It's not what you think!
I'm not going to "hook up" with her!

05:00.900 --> 05:01.360
I'm just going to...

05:01.360 --> 05:02.230
Keiichi?
I'm just going to...

05:02.230 --> 05:02.400
Keiichi?
Yes?!

05:02.400 --> 05:03.060
Yes?!

05:03.530 --> 05:09.870
Keiichi, it takes a great amount of energy
to express one's feelings like that.

05:09.870 --> 05:12.200
You must respond to her!

05:14.510 --> 05:17.680
In a way, I'd kind of rather she be
a little more jealous...

05:17.680 --> 05:18.650
Keiichi?

05:18.650 --> 05:19.580
Yes?!

05:19.580 --> 05:22.810
If you agree, then let's go and
respond to her right away.

05:23.350 --> 05:26.050
Uh, yeah... you're right!

05:36.860 --> 05:39.200
Please respond to her like you should!

05:41.000 --> 05:45.630
When she said that, I could see in her eyes
that she really meant it.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.130
But...

05:48.110 --> 05:51.810
She's not jealous even in
this kind of situation?

05:51.810 --> 05:55.080
Does she really trust me so fully?

05:55.080 --> 05:59.210
Or is it that I'm not even worth
getting jealous over?

06:03.220 --> 06:05.850
Whoa! She is CUTE!

06:07.160 --> 06:10.260
What'd I tell ya? I knew she'd be a cutie.

06:10.260 --> 06:15.070
There's just no way this is going to
work out THAT conveniently.

06:15.240 --> 06:18.770
What are you talking about?
Look at you blush.

06:18.770 --> 06:20.340
She's your type, isn't she?

06:20.340 --> 06:22.010
How could you say that?!

06:22.010 --> 06:23.640
What do you think, Belldandy?

06:27.050 --> 06:29.150
I think she's a very beautiful person.

06:29.150 --> 06:29.520
Huh?

06:29.520 --> 06:29.980
Huh?
It seems she's looking for someone...

06:29.980 --> 06:32.320
It seems she's looking for someone...

06:33.450 --> 06:35.120
It looks like she's noticed you.

06:35.120 --> 06:36.750
You did come after all!

06:39.390 --> 06:42.420
I'm so glad! I was starting to think
you wouldn't show up.

06:43.260 --> 06:45.600
Was it really her?

06:45.600 --> 06:48.900
That vulnerable smile is
too much for me to...

06:50.510 --> 06:54.340
Look, I was happy to get
that letter from you...

06:55.410 --> 06:56.710
But...

06:57.050 --> 06:59.850
I'm sorry! Your feelings are...

06:59.850 --> 07:00.180
Freeze!
I'm sorry! Your feelings are...

07:00.180 --> 07:00.550
Freeze!

07:00.550 --> 07:00.880
Freeze!
Huh?

07:00.880 --> 07:01.320
Huh?

07:01.320 --> 07:02.610
Don't move.

07:09.590 --> 07:10.890
I knew it!

07:11.190 --> 07:13.760
You've been possessed by something!

07:13.760 --> 07:16.630
You are giving off waves of energy
that are not human!

07:16.630 --> 07:17.030
WHAT?!

07:17.030 --> 07:17.730
Oh!
WHAT?!

07:17.730 --> 07:18.030
Oh!

07:18.270 --> 07:20.430
Don't tell me she knows about the goddesses!

07:20.900 --> 07:25.840
Ah! I'll use my power to send evil spirits
that torment people back to the darkness!

07:25.840 --> 07:28.270
It makes me shiver with excitement
just thinking about it!

07:29.340 --> 07:31.880
What? "Evil spirits"?

07:31.880 --> 07:33.380
Just you relax!

07:33.380 --> 07:37.580
I promise I'll exorcise the evil spirit
that's possessed you!

07:38.090 --> 07:41.320
Uh, are you an exorcist or something?

07:41.560 --> 07:44.530
Yes! I'm a 2nd year student in the
correspondence program.

07:44.860 --> 07:47.300
Sheesh... she's just an amateur.
I knew it from the moment I
first set eyes on you!
So that's what you meant...

07:47.300 --> 07:47.900
Sheesh... she's just an amateur.
I thought, "HE'LL be my first!"
So that's what you meant...

07:47.900 --> 07:49.620
I thought, "HE'LL be my first!"

07:49.830 --> 07:52.270
I'm going to exorcise you now!

07:52.270 --> 07:54.030
Okay! This is getting annoying!

07:54.670 --> 07:56.340
Why are you just standing there?!

07:56.340 --> 07:58.540
If you're gonna reject her,
then DO it already!

07:58.540 --> 08:01.510
What the hell? You were telling me
to hook up with her earlier!

08:02.010 --> 08:03.670
I was just teasing you.

08:04.010 --> 08:08.350
I can see it! A female specter who
will bring great disaster!

08:08.350 --> 08:08.750
It's not an evil spirit, it's my living soul!

08:08.750 --> 08:10.480
Augh! You've been cursed!
It's not an evil spirit, it's my living soul!

08:10.850 --> 08:14.690
Belldandy! You're also to blame!
Don't you have anything to say?

08:19.760 --> 08:23.600
Keiichi said that he wanted me to be here...

08:23.600 --> 08:26.290
that it would be all right
to stay by his side.

08:27.030 --> 08:31.300
So I will believe those words,
no matter what.

08:33.670 --> 08:35.640
Okay, I'm sick of this. Enough is enough...

08:43.480 --> 08:45.150
And so...

08:45.550 --> 08:50.080
I'll be starting my preparations now,
so no peeking, all right?

08:51.960 --> 08:56.900
Hey! What's the big deal with letting
some stranger use MY room?!

08:56.900 --> 08:58.900
She says it's facing the right direction.

08:58.900 --> 09:00.740
Direction for WHAT?!

09:00.740 --> 09:02.500
For exorcising evil spirits.

09:03.000 --> 09:04.010
Shock!

09:04.010 --> 09:06.100
You've gotta be kidding me...

09:06.570 --> 09:12.080
Night after night, the sound of footsteps echo
down the empty hallway, "thump, thump"...

09:12.080 --> 09:14.050
NO!

09:15.120 --> 09:17.890
Sorry about this, Belldandy.

09:17.890 --> 09:22.020
This is all because I wasn't
straight up with her.

09:23.120 --> 09:25.750
This isn't anything you need to apologize for.

09:26.230 --> 09:29.250
I was a little worried, though.

09:29.930 --> 09:33.960
I was worried that if she really
was in love with you...

09:34.970 --> 09:38.430
that you'd surely have ended up hurting her.

09:39.710 --> 09:42.800
Or am I just being conceited?

09:44.110 --> 09:45.080
No...

09:49.080 --> 09:50.550
Don't be silly!

09:51.020 --> 09:52.320
Keiichi!

09:54.160 --> 09:55.620
Thanks for waiting!

09:56.290 --> 09:58.060
Th-That outfit...

09:58.060 --> 10:01.360
Nice, isn't it? I made it myself.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.890
But more importantly...

10:05.630 --> 10:06.830
Be silent.

10:06.830 --> 10:07.300
Huh?
Be silent.

10:07.300 --> 10:07.640
Huh?
I'm going to synchronize our breathing.

10:07.640 --> 10:09.690
I'm going to synchronize our breathing.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.240
W-Whoa, hold on!

10:15.940 --> 10:18.740
You're getting too close...

10:27.660 --> 10:29.680
Poltergeists!

10:34.330 --> 10:36.960
So you've shown yourselves,
eh, evil spirits?!

10:39.670 --> 10:42.370
Come on! Come get some!

10:42.370 --> 10:44.340
What's all that stuff for?

10:47.310 --> 10:48.780
Oh, brother...

10:51.780 --> 10:52.480
NO!

10:52.480 --> 10:53.610
NO!
Yep, I knew you'd get it wrong.

10:53.610 --> 10:54.980
Yep, I knew you'd get it wrong.

10:54.980 --> 10:57.710
What you've got here SUMMONS
low-level evil spirits.

10:59.320 --> 11:02.190
Why is this kind of stuff
always happening to me?

11:02.190 --> 11:03.420
Belldandy.

11:05.130 --> 11:06.490
Belldandy!

11:07.760 --> 11:08.630
Wh-What is it, Urd?

11:08.630 --> 11:09.560
Belldandy?
Wh-What is it, Urd?

11:09.560 --> 11:10.130
Belldandy?
Help me peel off these talismans.

11:10.130 --> 11:11.530
Help me peel off these talismans.

11:11.530 --> 11:12.500
All right.

11:20.070 --> 11:23.270
I see! So my talismans worked
then, didn't they?!

11:23.540 --> 11:26.070
Aha! So I DO have the ability!

11:26.550 --> 11:28.450
Thank you! You're the first one!

11:28.450 --> 11:31.210
The first person to go all the way
in helping me with my hobby!

11:31.690 --> 11:36.020
Well, I could see in your eyes that
you were very serious about it.

11:36.020 --> 11:38.320
I just couldn't turn you down...

11:39.290 --> 11:43.250
And that side of you is part of
the reason I chose you.

11:43.660 --> 11:45.290
Ah, well...

11:45.700 --> 11:48.000
So then you don't dislike this kind of stuff?

11:48.340 --> 11:49.130
Huh?

11:50.170 --> 11:52.000
Thank you, Senior.

12:31.850 --> 12:33.070
Belldandy!

12:47.960 --> 12:49.690
Th-This is...

12:49.930 --> 12:52.800
a challenge aimed at me, isn't it?

12:53.000 --> 12:53.870
Well, I'm a little scared, but I'll be okay!

12:53.870 --> 12:54.870
Belldandy?
Well, I'm a little scared, but I'll be okay!

12:54.870 --> 12:55.340
Belldandy?
Please leave it to me!

12:55.340 --> 12:56.170
Please leave it to me!

12:56.170 --> 12:58.700
I'll get rid of them all this time,
just you wait and see!

12:59.410 --> 13:03.010
The technique I'm going to use next
is something I just learned,

13:03.010 --> 13:05.450
but it'll give me the greatest power!

13:05.450 --> 13:08.180
Senior, you just stay calm, okay?

13:08.480 --> 13:09.780
Right...

13:11.020 --> 13:15.320
Just leave it to my genius
to solve everything!

13:25.930 --> 13:27.920
Her power escaped?

13:28.170 --> 13:30.970
Right. Belldandy's did.

13:31.870 --> 13:32.940
Why?

13:32.940 --> 13:33.110
Banpei's broken!
Why?

13:33.110 --> 13:34.840
Banpei's broken!
You don't know?

13:34.840 --> 13:35.480
Banpei's broken!
Keiichi, how long have you
been with her anyway?

13:35.480 --> 13:36.580
Keiichi, how long have you
been with her anyway?

13:36.580 --> 13:38.310
Banpei!
Keiichi, how long have you
been with her anyway?

13:44.150 --> 13:45.410
It's jealousy.

13:45.890 --> 13:47.290
Jealousy?

13:48.320 --> 13:50.560
She's not some kind of doll, you know.

13:50.560 --> 13:53.560
She has those kinds of emotions, too.

13:53.560 --> 13:57.000
You're kidding. She's a goddess, and...

13:57.000 --> 13:59.330
..."so she couldn't," right?

13:59.330 --> 14:03.830
Falling in love with a person
isn't always pretty?

14:05.310 --> 14:09.610
It hurts her all the more
BECAUSE she's a goddess.

14:21.360 --> 14:26.550
This is the first time she's realized
her own sense of jealousy.

14:26.960 --> 14:29.860
So she's confused over
what she should do now.

14:30.200 --> 14:33.200
She could shut it all up inside...

14:33.200 --> 14:37.360
But, well, if she did that,
she'd explode before long.

14:38.510 --> 14:40.130
Belldandy...

14:42.310 --> 14:43.610
Why?

14:44.750 --> 14:46.950
I feel a whirlwind of emotions inside...

14:46.950 --> 14:49.750
I can't manage to suppress this dark emotion.

14:56.060 --> 14:58.580
What's happened to me?

15:01.160 --> 15:04.220
Somebody... help me!

15:10.700 --> 15:13.870
INRI. Yod. Nun. Resh. Yod.

15:14.680 --> 15:15.040
Virgo, Isis, Mighty Mother.
Scorpio, Apophis, Destroyer.

15:15.040 --> 15:16.380
Urd!
Virgo, Isis, Mighty Mother.
Scorpio, Apophis, Destroyer.

15:16.380 --> 15:18.480
Oh, come on! Stop being such a pain!
Virgo, Isis, Mighty Mother.
Scorpio, Apophis, Destroyer.

15:18.480 --> 15:20.250
If you're scared then get out of here!
Virgo, Isis, Mighty Mother.
Scorpio, Apophis, Destroyer.

15:20.250 --> 15:20.680
But I'd be even MORE scared alone!
Virgo, Isis, Mighty Mother.
Scorpio, Apophis, Destroyer.

15:20.680 --> 15:23.420
But I'd be even MORE scared alone!
Sol, Osiris, Slain and Risen.
Isis, Apophis, Osiris, IAO.

15:23.420 --> 15:24.880
Sol, Osiris, Slain and Risen.
Isis, Apophis, Osiris, IAO.

15:25.050 --> 15:27.290
What's the matter, Keiichi?

15:27.290 --> 15:29.450
Ah, nothing...

15:31.190 --> 15:33.520
You know, Belldandy...

15:33.960 --> 15:34.830
Yes?

15:34.830 --> 15:39.530
I want you to know that I didn't mean
for things to turn out like this.

15:40.500 --> 15:44.140
I should have been more upfront with her.

15:44.140 --> 15:47.600
It's nothing you should take to heart.

15:48.340 --> 15:49.870
Keiichi...

15:50.080 --> 15:51.310
Senior!

15:51.950 --> 15:54.180
Please be quiet!

15:54.180 --> 15:55.980
It'll only take a little longer.

15:55.980 --> 15:57.470
Oh... Sorry!

16:00.850 --> 16:02.480
No! I'm so scared!

16:05.330 --> 16:09.490
INRI. Yod. Nun. Resh. Yod.

16:09.630 --> 16:12.700
No! No! NO!
Isis, Apophis, Osiris... IAO!

16:12.700 --> 16:15.460
Isis, Apophis, Osiris... IAO!

16:16.170 --> 16:17.500
ARARITA!

16:19.840 --> 16:20.370
Waugh! It's burning! I'm outta here!

16:20.370 --> 16:22.780
Waugh! It's burning! I'm outta here!
Urd, is this going to be all right?

16:22.780 --> 16:24.810
HELP!
What would I know about a worthless
incantation like that?

16:24.810 --> 16:25.740
What would I know about a worthless
incantation like that?

16:31.220 --> 16:31.920
That's...

16:31.920 --> 16:32.650
NO! NO! URD!
That's...

16:32.650 --> 16:33.090
NO! NO! URD!

16:33.090 --> 16:36.360
NO! NO! URD!
I did it! I summoned Kundalini!

16:36.360 --> 16:37.320
What?!

16:38.330 --> 16:40.860
My name is Garm.

16:40.860 --> 16:44.020
I am watchdog over the dark world Niflheim.

16:44.230 --> 16:44.870
No! Make it stop! No!

16:44.870 --> 16:46.000
No! Make it stop! No!
State your intent now, Summoner.

16:46.000 --> 16:48.100
She's brought us another pain...
No! Make it stop! No!
State your intent now, Summoner.

16:48.100 --> 16:48.730
She's brought us another pain...
State your intent now, Summoner.

16:49.040 --> 16:51.440
Actually, you're not the one
I was calling for.

16:51.440 --> 16:52.430
Whoa! Idiot!

16:52.640 --> 16:54.070
The audacity!

16:54.070 --> 16:57.240
You dare summon mighty Garm
without reason?!

16:57.240 --> 16:59.410
Look, I'm saying you're not the one
I was calling for, all right?

16:59.680 --> 17:02.380
Ten thousand deaths are not enough for you!

17:08.460 --> 17:09.550
Urd!

17:12.360 --> 17:13.690
Skuld! Hurry up and erase those magic signs!

17:13.690 --> 17:15.590
I'm so scared...
Skuld! Hurry up and erase those magic signs!

17:15.830 --> 17:18.830
They're written in permanent marker,
so they won't come off!

17:18.830 --> 17:21.570
Then rewrite them as an
anti-demonic program!

17:21.570 --> 17:24.300
I don't know how to write
those kinds of formulas!

17:27.110 --> 17:28.800
At this rate...

17:29.410 --> 17:31.880
An anti-demonic program
won't work on Garm.

17:32.410 --> 17:34.050
We must use a banishment program.

17:34.050 --> 17:34.950
Belldandy!

17:35.280 --> 17:37.420
I'm tied up with him!

17:37.420 --> 17:39.720
Belldandy, you'll have to do it!

17:40.750 --> 17:41.740
Belldandy!

17:44.930 --> 17:46.360
Belldandy...

17:47.960 --> 17:51.090
It's no use. I don't know it...

17:51.600 --> 17:53.070
I can't move...

17:54.000 --> 17:58.300
I'm scared! It won't erase! I'm scared!

18:01.940 --> 18:04.570
It's no use... He's too strong!

18:05.050 --> 18:06.010
Urd!

18:06.180 --> 18:07.080
Urd!

18:08.420 --> 18:10.210
I've reached my limit!

18:11.920 --> 18:12.980
Urd!

18:13.220 --> 18:14.620
Senior! Save me!

18:14.790 --> 18:16.980
Whoa, hey! Let go!

18:26.930 --> 18:28.730
What was that?!

18:29.100 --> 18:30.370
Belldandy!

18:30.370 --> 18:31.430
I'm scared!

18:32.040 --> 18:34.510
Was that... my...

18:34.710 --> 18:38.550
I see. All the pent up jealousy
has weakened her seal.

18:38.550 --> 18:41.980
If she could hit Garm directly with this power,

18:41.980 --> 18:45.580
she'd be able to send him back.

18:46.550 --> 18:47.920
But...

18:49.860 --> 18:53.030
I'm sorry. I'm going to have to
pull something a little dirty.

18:53.030 --> 18:54.080
Forgive me.

18:56.730 --> 18:58.860
No! Senior!

19:03.670 --> 19:04.690
Secret Technique!

19:07.510 --> 19:10.100
Remote Human Manipulation!

19:17.280 --> 19:19.180
I'm sorry, Keiichi.

19:20.250 --> 19:23.820
What the hell am I doing?!

19:24.420 --> 19:25.890
I understand.

19:27.090 --> 19:29.860
I was afraid...

19:38.140 --> 19:39.400
Belldandy!

20:08.440 --> 20:09.990
Belldandy...

20:10.370 --> 20:12.570
I'm a terrible person.

20:12.840 --> 20:16.110
I thought I was concerned about
her getting hurt,

20:16.110 --> 20:20.570
but I was even more afraid of losing you.

20:21.150 --> 20:24.580
Even though I had said that I trust you...

20:24.950 --> 20:26.350
Belldandy...

20:26.350 --> 20:30.220
Keiichi! You must hate me now!

20:30.860 --> 20:34.130
No, you're wrong! I'm the one
who should be apologizing!

20:34.130 --> 20:38.060
I took your trust for granted.

20:38.500 --> 20:43.630
Urd told me that falling in love with
a person isn't always pretty.

20:44.500 --> 20:51.110
Maybe being in love with someone means
that you want to be with that person

20:51.110 --> 20:54.270
even when you're upset or
crying or laughing.

20:55.820 --> 21:00.450
Belldandy, I want to be with you.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.320
Keiichi...

21:08.030 --> 21:09.660
Thank you!

21:14.740 --> 21:16.360
Belldandy...

21:18.170 --> 21:19.640
Keiichi...

21:24.650 --> 21:28.780
Even if I did plan all this myself,
what in the world is this itchy feeling?

21:29.250 --> 21:30.480
I did it!

21:31.250 --> 21:32.190
Hey! What are you gonna do about my room?!

21:32.190 --> 21:35.620
Hey! What are you gonna do about my room?!
This proves that I really am
a genius after all!

21:35.620 --> 21:38.860
These magic signs still won't even come off!
I will continue to use this power
to make everyone happy!

21:38.860 --> 21:39.290
I will continue to use this power
to make everyone happy!

21:39.290 --> 21:41.060
Thank you so much!

21:41.060 --> 21:44.230
Hey, I'm talking to YOU!
Well, the fact that she was able to summon
Garm might make her a genius,

21:44.230 --> 21:44.970
Huh? Oh, you were still at it?
Well, the fact that she was able to summon
Garm might make her a genius,

21:44.970 --> 21:46.300
Huh? Oh, you were still at it?
Even if it was a mistake...

21:46.300 --> 21:48.070
What did you say?!

21:48.070 --> 21:48.970
You should be grateful just to have been
able to assist a genius in her research!

21:48.970 --> 21:52.370
Obsessive, overconfident,
inexperienced, and cocky...
You should be grateful just to have been
able to assist a genius in her research!

21:52.370 --> 21:53.510
Obsessive, overconfident,
inexperienced, and cocky...
Wait a minute. Are you serious about that?!

21:53.510 --> 21:55.240
Yep, they're birds of a feather.
Wait a minute. Are you serious about that?!

21:55.240 --> 21:58.780
Let me tell you something about geniuses:
You happen to be looking at one right now!

21:58.780 --> 22:02.150
Oh? And what exactly makes YOU a genius?

22:02.150 --> 22:04.380
Care to show me?

22:04.380 --> 22:06.980
Okay, you asked for it! Here I go!

22:25.310 --> 22:33.740
Woh, it starts to shine

22:43.220 --> 22:50.530
The gentle wind I felt on my cheek

22:51.870 --> 22:59.290
Was the start of the miracles you brought

22:59.970 --> 23:07.440
As though my everyday life until
then had never existed

23:07.810 --> 23:13.050
My new happy life, completely repainted

23:13.050 --> 23:16.450
In the colors of spring

23:17.120 --> 23:21.400
Even waking up early, even traffic jams

23:21.400 --> 23:25.800
Even heavy things to carry,
even sleepless nights

23:25.800 --> 23:30.140
Somehow I feel thankful for everything

23:30.140 --> 23:34.840
Let's create more and more of our miracles

23:34.840 --> 23:42.680
Woh, whatever kind of morning

23:43.450 --> 23:51.190
Woh, it starts to shine

23:51.890 --> 23:54.690
Every day is a miracle

23:55.430 --> 23:57.600
It should have been another mistake.

23:57.600 --> 24:02.240
Appearing with the scent of roses,
she rejects momentary reunion.

24:02.240 --> 24:04.600
Next time, "Ah! I Shall Grant Your Wish!"

24:04.600 --> 24:05.540
Ah! I Shall Grant Your Wish!
Next time, "Ah! I Shall Grant Your Wish!"

24:05.540 --> 24:09.380
Ah! I Shall Grant Your Wish!
Yes, we know that your service
is the best in Heaven.
